{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Consent","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"title":"Consent","roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Consent.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Consent.swift#L42"}},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:heldRecordLimit:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/heldRecordCount"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/deny(_:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/grant(_:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/status(of:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/defaultHeldRecordLimit"],"generated":true,"title":"Type Properties","anchor":"Type-Properties"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The user’s consent, category by category, which a tracker given it applies to every event."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The app makes one where it starts, from the decisions it saved, gives it to its tracker, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"updates it as the user decides:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let consent = Consent([.analytics: .granted])","let tracker = Tracker(consent: consent)","\/\/ Later, from the consent prompt:","consent.grant(.advertising)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each event is gated by its type’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"Event.consentCategory","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", by the decisions made before it was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracked:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Granted:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" delivered as any event is, written to the tracker’s store first if it has one.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Undecided:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" held in memory, and not written to the store, until the category is decided."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Granting it delivers its held events in the order they were tracked, before any event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked after the grant; denying it drops them, reported on "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports"},{"type":"text","text":". The hold keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at most "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"heldRecordLimit"},{"type":"text","text":" events across every category and tracker: when it is full, its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"oldest is dropped to make room, reported as it happens (merged with the overflow reports"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not yet read). Held events are lost if the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ends first."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Denied:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" dropped, and not collected at all, so not reported.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Records a store recovered from an earlier run are gated again as the tracker starts, as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consent may have changed since. One whose category is now denied is dropped, reported and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"forgotten by the store. One whose category is undecided is held outside the bound, still kept","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by the store, so a full hold never drops it; if the app ends first, it is gated again on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"next launch. One the store drops for its own byte bound while held is reported by the store","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and still delivered if granted in this run, as a record a delivery has already read is.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A category not given a status is undecided. Withdrawing consent is a denial: records the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker had already let through when it was granted are still delivered."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Copies share one set of decisions and one hold. A decision returns at once, from any thread:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it records the status, which "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/status(of:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returns from then on, and queues the decision"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for each tracker given the consent, whose own worker releases or drops what it held. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker reports its own drops."}]}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentStatus","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentDropReport","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/NegativeHeldRecordLimit"],"generated":true,"title":"Consent","anchor":"Consent"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/consent"]}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/init(_:)":{"title":"init(_:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"([","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsentCategory","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events15ConsentCategoryV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsentStatus","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers13ConsentStatusO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"])","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/init(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A consent with the categories in "},{"code":"statuses","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" decided, and every other undecided, holding"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at most "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/defaultHeldRecordLimit"},{"type":"text","text":" records while undecided."}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/heldRecordCount":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/heldRecordCount","title":"heldRecordCount","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/heldrecordcount","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"How many records are held, waiting for their category to be decided: those held in memory","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only and those a store recovered.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"heldRecordCount","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/ConsentStatus":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ConsentStatus"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ConsentStatus"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consentstatus","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where the user stands on one consent category."}],"title":"ConsentStatus","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentStatus"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/deny(_:)":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deny","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events15ConsentCategoryV","text":"ConsentCategory","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"...)","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/deny(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/deny(_:)","title":"deny(_:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Denies "},{"code":"categories","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": their held events are dropped, reported on "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", and later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ones are not collected."}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Tr